  "description": "UMELIJ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C34 H74 Ce2 Co2 O44 P6 Re6,4(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Ce1 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Ce2 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Re1 (Re) has 4 O neighbors; Re2 (Re) has 4 O neighbors; Re3 (Re) has 4 O neighbors; Re4 (Re) has 4 O neighbors; Re5 (Re) has 4 O neighbors; Re6 (Re) has 4 O neighbors; Co1 (Co) has 0 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 3 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.900-4.150 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 146.88-164.76°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C34H74Ce2Co2O44P6Re6. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
